uch faster than racing outdoors, without the influence of the weather. As in 1972, the track length was 285.714 metres, or 3½ laps to the kilometre."] "\n\n" [:p {} "German riders won three events, with East German " [:a {:href "/athletes/14584"} "Klaus-Jürgen Grünke"] " winning the kilometre time trial, West German " [:a {:href "/athletes/13708"} "Gregor Braun"] " taking the individual pursuit, and the West German pursuit team bringing home gold. Czechoslovakian " [:a {:href "/athletes/16857"} "Anton Tkáč"] " won the match sprint."] "\n\n"] "\n\n" [:h2 {} "Events"] "\n" [:table {:class "table table-striped"} "\n" [:thead {} "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Event"] "\n" [:th {} "Status"] "\n" [:th {} "Date"] "\n" [:th {} "Participants"] "\n" [:th {} "NOCs"] "\n"] "\n"] "\n" [:tbody {} [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/154285"} "Sprint, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "21 – 24 July 1976"] "\n" [:td {} "25"] "\n" [:td {} "25"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/154284"} "1,000 metres Time Trial, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "20 July 1976"] "\n" [:td {} "30"] "\n" [:td {} "30"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/154333"} "Individual Pursuit (4,000 metres), Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "20 – 22 July 1976"] "\n" [:td {} "27"] "\n" [:td {} "27"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/154355"} "Team Pursuit (4,000 metres), Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "23 – 24 July 1976"] "\n" [:td {} "64"] "\n" [:td {} "16"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td {:class "border-top"} "\n121 (121/0)\n"] "\n" [:td {:class "border-top"} "\n36 (36/0)\n"] "\n"] "\n"]] "\n\n\n" [:h2 {} "Medals"] "\n" [:table {:class "table table-striped"} "\n" [:thead {} "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Event"] "\n" [:th {:colspan "2"} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] "\n" [:th {:colspan "2"} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] "\n" [:th {:colspan "2"} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "